  "clapSurface": {
    "$comment": "Every authored Clap command path joins exactly once to this recursive inventory. Authorship is captured before Command.build(): framework-generated help/version arguments and the generated help subcommand are excluded, while authored Help/Version actions and an authored help subcommand remain inventory entries. Positionals are included; an unbounded positional that accepts hyphen-prefixed values is classified as passthrough. Commands and options are sorted deterministically. Each argument records action, arity, requiredness, value names and domain, enum values and aliases, defaults, default-missing values, and hyphen handling; maxValues null means unbounded. semanticRelations additionally records every reflected argument conflict and a stable reviewed parser kind for each non-enumerated value. Clap source attributes are fail-closed against an explicit reviewed key set so an unrepresented parser relation cannot appear silently. This is an exact contract for those recorded semantics, not a claim that help text and every internal Clap setting are serialized.",
